{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207380","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207380","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1720738001:1":{"text":"Madam, I'm sorry for your loss. This bouquet is for you.","source_cn":"夫人，请节哀。这是……这是我为您准备的花。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBAD6D707C87AE7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:2::2":{"text":"Exquisite Bouquet","source_cn":"白玫瑰花束","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9E4E0B7E8995E8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720738002:0":{"text":"For me?","source_cn":"这是……给我的？<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A92B649CDA9EBC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720738003:1":{"text":"Yes, I hope it brings you solace.","source_cn":"是的。希望能带给您一丝慰藉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DBB9D74072993F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720738004:1":{"text":"I appreciate your kindness, young lady, but this bouquet is... a little too fancy.","source_cn":"谢谢你的好意，小姑娘。但这花……太华丽了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x785DBD5E73EAA171","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720738005:0":{"text":"It'd fit well on a dressing table or in a crystal vase in the palace, but not before a grave.","source_cn":"它适合摆在铺着天鹅绒桌布的梳妆台上，或者插在王宫的水晶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FBB8CB7AA3CAC56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720738006:0":{"text":"Because its brightness only deepens the gloom of this grave.","source_cn":"放在坟墓前的话，只会让这冰冷的墓碑看起来更加凄凉吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33643D13A421B6A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720738007:1":{"text":"B-But...","source_cn":"可、可是……<key:dialog37>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x402656A775F521A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1720738008:1":{"text":"My son, Julino, lost his life in the Divine War twenty years ago.","source_cn":"我的儿子朱利诺，是在二十年前的那场神魔大战中牺牲的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9805973512A5E869","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720738009:1":{"text":"He was still so young when he left for the battlefield to protect Savannah...","source_cn":"那时候，他还那么年轻，为了保护身后的赛凡纳，他义无反顾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93C00E08418D01F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720738010:1":{"text":"But now... no one remembers him, nor the other young souls who perished in the war. Everyone celebrates Savannah's prosperity at the festival, yet they forget what it cost.","source_cn":"可是现在，还有谁记得他？还有谁记得那些像他一样死去的孩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B963CCB34345446","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1720738011:1":{"text":"I have no need for such lovely flowers, young lady. I only wish one more person would remember what my son sacrificed for Savannah.","source_cn":"姑娘，我不需要这些漂亮的花。我只想让多一个人知道，曾经...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8886449931F561F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1720738012:1":{"text":"He died... for Savannah...","source_cn":"为了……赛凡纳……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FE0F63F1B3A48FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1720738013:1":{"text":"Sorry, madam... Thank you for sharing this with me. Julino... I'll keep that name in mind.","source_cn":"对不起……夫人。还有，谢谢你告诉我这些。我会把朱利诺这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18E731CDC57B3603","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1720738013":{"text":"Sorry, madam... Thank you for sharing this with me. Julino... I'll keep that name in mind.","source_cn":"对不起……夫人。还有，谢谢你告诉我这些。我会把朱利诺这个名字记在心里的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18E731CDC57B3603","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1720738014:2":{"text":"We should go. Let's give the lady some time alone with her son...","source_cn":"佩吉，我们走吧。让她和朱利诺……单独待一会儿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD22BA9CD3C46A60E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"(Give Peggy a reassuring pat on the shoulder)","source_cn":"（安慰地拍拍佩吉的肩）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x241D59032133F110","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(Give Peggy a reassuring pat on the shoulder)","female":"(Give Peggy a reassuring pat on the shoulder)","variant_male_record_index":"90171","variant_female_record_index":"90172","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:1:2":{"text":"(Bow before the grave together with Peggy)","source_cn":"（和佩吉一起向墓碑鞠躬）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7269F2A01C2B6177","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(Bow before the grave together with Peggy)","female":"(Bow before the grave together with Peggy)","variant_male_record_index":"90173","variant_female_record_index":"90174","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:佩吉":{"text":"Peggy","source":"佩吉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speak